  "description": "ODAJOU crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H104 Dy4 N10 O26 2+,2(N1 O3 1-),3(C1 H4 O1),H2 O1. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy1A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3A (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4A (Dy) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a chain with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.723-3.747 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.34-112.24°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy4(dhampH3)4(NO3)2](NO3)2·3CH3OH·H2O (C67H118Dy4N12O36). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
